flowchart TD
    UninstallStart([Uninstall lifecycle]) --> UninstallAcquire[Acquire 全局锁]
    UninstallAcquire -->|failure| UninstallFatal([fatal error；无业务汇总])
    UninstallAcquire -->|success| UninstallRecover[TransactionManager.Recover]
    UninstallRecover -->|recovered| UninstallRecoverWarn[锁内同步 recovery Warn]
    UninstallRecover -->|no journal| UninstallRefresh[RefreshInstalled]
    UninstallRecoverWarn --> UninstallRefresh
    UninstallRecover -->|failure| UninstallReleaseFatal[Release]
    UninstallRefresh -->|failure / invalid target / empty all| UninstallReleaseFatal
    UninstallRefresh -->|success| UninstallNext{next Agent?}

    UninstallNext -->|yes| UninstallList[ConfigRepository.List]
    UninstallList -->|no record| UninstallNotInstalledWarn[锁内同步 not-installed Warn]
    UninstallNotInstalledWarn --> UninstallAgentOnlyUnexecuted[Agent-only unexecuted]
    UninstallAgentOnlyUnexecuted --> UninstallNext

    UninstallList -->|read failure / ambiguity| UninstallAgentOnlyFailed[Agent-only failed]
    UninstallAgentOnlyFailed --> UninstallFillLater[后续 Agent-only unexecuted]
    UninstallList -->|unique local PowerRef| UninstallResolve[AdapterRegistry.Resolve]
    UninstallResolve -->|failure| UninstallFullFailed[full-ref failed]
    UninstallResolve -->|success| UninstallTransaction[TransactionManager.Uninstall]

    subgraph UninstallTx[TransactionManager；ADR-009]
        UninstallTransaction --> UninstallTargetPath[Adapter.TargetPath]
        UninstallTargetPath --> UninstallJournal[验证路径并驱动 removing / rolling-back / committing journal]
        UninstallJournal --> UninstallTxReturn[返回 Transaction UninstallResult.TargetMissing + error]
    end

    UninstallTxReturn -->|TargetMissing=true| UninstallMissingWarn[锁内同步 full-ref target-missing Warn]
    UninstallMissingWarn --> UninstallTxError{error?}
    UninstallTxReturn -->|TargetMissing=false| UninstallTxError
    UninstallTxError -->|no| UninstallCompleted[full-ref completed]
    UninstallTxError -->|yes| UninstallFullFailed
    UninstallCompleted --> UninstallNext
    UninstallFullFailed --> UninstallFillLater
    UninstallFillLater --> UninstallReleaseBatch[Release]

    UninstallNext -->|no| UninstallReleaseSuccess[Release]
    UninstallReleaseFatal -->|success| UninstallFatal
    UninstallReleaseFatal -->|failure| UninstallSuppress[返回 zero result；抑制 summary]
    UninstallReleaseBatch -->|success| UninstallRenderBatch[CLI render completed / failed / unexecuted]
    UninstallRenderBatch --> UninstallBatchError([return UninstallBatchError])
    UninstallReleaseBatch -->|failure| UninstallSuppress
    UninstallReleaseSuccess -->|success| UninstallRender[CLI render completed / unexecuted]
    UninstallReleaseSuccess -->|failure| UninstallSuppress
    UninstallRender --> UninstallOK([success])
    UninstallSuppress --> UninstallReleaseError([Release error])

    style UninstallTx fill:#fff4e5,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px
